#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Endpoint | Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `GET /v1/jobs`, `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics` | `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/workloads` | `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
"| `POST /v1/sessions`, `GET /v1/sessions/{id}` | `elapsed_time` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/instances/usage` | `usage_consumed_seconds`, `usage_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru`, `usage_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}` | `plans[].usage_limit_seconds`, `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru`, `plans[].usage_allocation_ru`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
"| Resource Controller API: Create, update, and read service instances | `instance_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date` | Each usage field in milliseconds | The matching field with the `_ru` suffix |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Endpoint | Ignorar | Leer en su lugar |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `GET /v1/jobs`, `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics` | `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/workloads` | `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
"| `POST /v1/sessions`, `GET /v1/sessions/{id}` | `elapsed_time` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/instances/usage` | `usage_consumed_seconds`, `usage_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru`, `usage_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}` | `plans[].usage_limit_seconds`, `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru`, `plans[].usage_allocation_ru`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
"| Resource Controller API: crear, actualizar y leer instancias de servicio | `instance_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date` | Cada campo de uso en milisegundos | El campo equivalente con el sufijo `_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The sections that follow give the details for each endpoint.\n"
msgstr "Las secciones siguientes ofrecen los detalles de cada endpoint.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Jobs {#jobs}"
msgstr "Trabajos {#jobs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/jobs` and `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoints: `GET /v1/jobs` y `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ignorar | Leer en su lugar |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `usage` object also has these fields:\n"
msgstr "El objeto `usage` también tiene estos campos:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.unit`: The unit of `usage.value`. The value is always `\"resource_units\"`.\n"
msgstr "`usage.unit`: La unidad de `usage.value`. El valor es siempre `\"resource_units\"`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.status`: The billing status. The value is `\"pending\"` or `\"complete\"`. If the status is `\"pending\"`, the platform can still change the value. Do not use a pending value as the final usage.\n"
msgstr "`usage.status`: El estado de facturación. El valor es `\"pending\"` o `\"complete\"`. Si el estado es `\"pending\"`, la plataforma todavía puede cambiar el valor. No uses un valor pendiente como el uso final.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[]`: The usage for each billing metric. The `value` of each entry is in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[]`: El uso de cada métrica de facturación. El `value` de cada entrada está en RU.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Example:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The field `usage.details[].metric.value` is not the usage in RUs. It is the quantity of the metric that the platform used to calculate the RUs. Each metric has its own unit. For example, the unit of a QPU metric is seconds. For the usage, read `usage.details[].value`.\n"
msgstr "El campo `usage.details[].metric.value` no es el uso en RU. Es la cantidad de la métrica que la plataforma utilizó para calcular las RU. Cada métrica tiene su propia unidad. Por ejemplo, la unidad de una métrica de QPU es segundos. Para el uso, lee `usage.details[].value`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workloads {#workloads}"
msgstr "Cargas de trabajo {#workloads}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/workloads`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/workloads`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each item in `workloads[]` has a `usage` object. This object has the same fields as the `usage` object of a job.\n"
msgstr "Cada elemento de `workloads[]` tiene un objeto `usage`. Este objeto tiene los mismos campos que el objeto `usage` de un trabajo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ignorar | Leer en su lugar |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a workload is still running, `usage` is `null`.\n"
msgstr "Si una carga de trabajo todavía se está ejecutando, `usage` es `null`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function workloads {#function-workloads}"
msgstr "Cargas de trabajo de funciones {#function-workloads}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The usage of a function workload is in RUs, the same as for a QPU workload. A function workload can use more than one metric:\n"
msgstr "El uso de una carga de trabajo de función está en RU, igual que el de una carga de trabajo de QPU. Una carga de trabajo de función puede usar más de una métrica:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**QPU usage.** This is metered per second of quantum time. See [Execution modes](/guides/execution-modes).\n"
msgstr "**Uso de QPU.** Se mide por segundo de tiempo cuántico. Consulta [Modos de ejecución](/guides/execution-modes).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Classical compute usage.** This is metered per second of [classical time](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"
msgstr "**Uso de cómputo clásico.** Se mide por segundo de [tiempo clásico](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Execution license cost.** This is metered per workload, based on the [size of the problem passed to a function](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"
msgstr "**Costo de la licencia de ejecución.** Se mide por carga de trabajo, según el [tamaño del problema que se pasa a una función](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The platform converts the quantity of each metric to RUs. Thus, all usage values are in RUs:\n"
msgstr "La plataforma convierte la cantidad de cada métrica a RU. Así, todos los valores de uso están en RU:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.value` is the usage of the workload, in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.value` es el uso de la carga de trabajo, en RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[].value` is the usage for one metric, in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[].value` es el uso de una métrica, en RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[].metric.value` is the quantity of the metric, in the unit of that metric. It is not in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[].metric.value` es la cantidad de la métrica, en la unidad de dicha métrica. No está en RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you show or add usage values, use `usage.value` and `usage.details[].value`. Do not use `usage.details[].metric.value`.\n"
msgstr "Si muestras o sumas valores de uso, usa `usage.value` y `usage.details[].value`. No uses `usage.details[].metric.value`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sessions {#sessions}"
msgstr "Sesiones {#sessions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `POST /v1/sessions` and `GET /v1/sessions/{id}`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoints: `POST /v1/sessions` y `GET /v1/sessions/{id}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `elapsed_time` (seconds) | `usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ignorar | Leer en su lugar |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `elapsed_time` (segundos) | `usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The session `usage` object has `unit` and `details[]`. These fields work the same as in the job `usage` object, with the exception of the `status` field, which is omitted for sessions.\n"
msgstr "El objeto `usage` de la sesión tiene `unit` y `details[]`. Estos campos funcionan igual que en el objeto `usage` del trabajo, con la excepción del campo `status`, que se omite en las sesiones.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, and `active_ttl` do not change. They are time limits (TTL means \"time to live\"), not usage. Their unit stays seconds.\n"
msgstr "Los campos `interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl` y `active_ttl` no cambian. Son límites de tiempo (TTL significa \"time to live\", tiempo de vida), no uso. Su unidad sigue siendo segundos.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance usage {#instance-usage}"
msgstr "Uso de la instancia {#instance-usage}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/instances/usage`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/instances/usage`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage_consumed_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_limit_seconds` | `usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ignorar | Leer en su lugar |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage_consumed_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_limit_seconds` | `usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `usage_limit_reached`, `usage_period`, and `time_available_at` do not change.\n"
msgstr "Los campos `usage_limit_reached`, `usage_period` y `time_available_at` no cambian.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Account plans {#account-plans}"
msgstr "Planes de la cuenta {#account-plans}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/accounts/{id}`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/accounts/{id}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each item in `plans[]` has these changes:\n"
msgstr "Cada elemento de `plans[]` tiene estos cambios:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_limit_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds` | `plans[].usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ignorar | Leer en su lugar |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_limit_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds` | `plans[].usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Service instances in the Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"
msgstr "Instancias de servicio en la Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API is a separate API. You use it to create and update service instances. If you create or update instances with this API, change the instance parameters too.\n"
msgstr "La IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API es una API independiente. La usas para crear y actualizar instancias de servicio. Si creas o actualizas instancias con esta API, cambia también los parámetros de la instancia.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you create or update an instance, send these parameters in the request:\n"
msgstr "Cuando creas o actualizas una instancia, envía estos parámetros en la solicitud:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Don't send | Send instead | Type of the new parameter |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| No envíes | Envía en su lugar | Tipo del nuevo parámetro |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Número o `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Número o `null` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The parameters have these meanings:\n"
msgstr "Los parámetros tienen estos significados:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Instance limit**The maximum usage for the instance. If you do not send a limit on the Open Plan, the default is the RU equivalent of 10 minutes.\n"
msgstr "**Límite de la instancia**El uso máximo de la instancia. Si no envías un límite en el Open Plan, el valor predeterminado es el equivalente en RU de 10 minutos.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage allocation**: The share of usage for the instance. The fair-share scheduler uses this value to set the priority of the instance in the queue. The allocation does not apply to Pay-As-You-Go instances.\n"
msgstr "**Asignación de uso**: La parte del uso destinada a la instancia. El programador de recursos compartidos (fair-share scheduler) usa este valor para establecer la prioridad de la instancia en la cola. La asignación no se aplica a las instancias Pay-As-You-Go.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you read an instance, the `extensions` object in the response contains the old fields and the new fields. Disregard `instance_limit_seconds` and `usage_allocation_seconds`. Read `instance_limit_ru` and `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"
msgstr "Cuando lees una instancia, el objeto `extensions` de la respuesta contiene los campos antiguos y los nuevos. Ignora `instance_limit_seconds` y `usage_allocation_seconds`. Lee `instance_limit_ru` y `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more information, see the [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"
msgstr "Para más información, consulta la [documentación de la REST API del IBM Quantum Compute Service](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage analytics {#usage-analytics}"
msgstr "Analíticas de uso {#usage-analytics}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, and `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoints: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped` y `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The three endpoints have the same usage fields. The two grouped endpoints return these fields for each group or each date.\n"
msgstr "Los tres endpoints tienen los mismos campos de uso. Los dos endpoints agrupados devuelven estos campos para cada grupo o cada fecha.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The old analytics usage fields are in milliseconds, not seconds.\n"
msgstr "Los antiguos campos de uso de las analíticas están en milisegundos, no en segundos.\n"

