# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The total in `usage_ru` includes more than the total in `usage`:\n"
msgstr "El total de `usage_ru` incluye más que el total de `usage`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage` is the sum of QPU time for sessions, individual jobs, and functions.\n"
msgstr "`usage` es la suma del tiempo de QPU de las sesiones, los trabajos individuales y las funciones.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage_ru` is the sum of usage for sessions, individual jobs, and functions. For functions, it also includes classical compute and license cost.\n"
msgstr "`usage_ru` es la suma del uso de las sesiones, los trabajos individuales y las funciones. En el caso de las funciones, también incluye el cómputo clásico y el costo de la licencia.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thus, `usage_ru` is not only `usage` in a different unit.\n"
msgstr "Por tanto, `usage_ru` no es solo `usage` en otra unidad.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `queue_time`, `avg_queue_time`, and `max_queue_time` do not change. They measure wait time, not usage. Their unit stays milliseconds.\n"
msgstr "Los campos `queue_time`, `avg_queue_time` y `max_queue_time` no cambian. Miden el tiempo de espera, no el uso. Su unidad sigue siendo milisegundos.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields that do not change {#fields-that-do-not-change}"
msgstr "Campos que no cambian {#fields-that-do-not-change}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These fields contain time values, but they do not measure usage. IBM Quantum does not plan to replace them:\n"
msgstr "Estos campos contienen valores de tiempo, pero no miden el uso. IBM Quantum no planea reemplazarlos:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`wait_time_seconds` on backends: The estimated wait in the queue.\n"
msgstr "`wait_time_seconds` en los backends: La espera estimada en la cola.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`circuits_execution_time_ns` in `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`: The time that the job ran on the QPU.\n"
msgstr "`circuits_execution_time_ns` en `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`: El tiempo que el trabajo se ejecutó en la QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, and `active_ttl` on sessions.\n"
msgstr "`interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl` y `active_ttl` en las sesiones.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`queue_time`, `avg_queue_time`, and `max_queue_time` in analytics.\n"
msgstr "`queue_time`, `avg_queue_time` y `max_queue_time` en las analíticas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`rep_times` and `circuit_duration` in backend configuration.\n"
msgstr "`rep_times` y `circuit_duration` en la configuración del backend.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration steps {#migration-steps}"
msgstr "Pasos de migración {#migration-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find each old field in your code. Search for `qpu_charge_time_seconds`, `elapsed_time`, the `_seconds` fields in this guide, and the analytics fields in milliseconds.\n"
msgstr "Encuentra cada campo antiguo en tu código. Busca `qpu_charge_time_seconds`, `elapsed_time`, los campos `_seconds` de esta guía y los campos de analíticas en milisegundos.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change each old field to the RU field in the tables of this guide.\n"
msgstr "Cambia cada campo antiguo por el campo de RU indicado en las tablas de esta guía.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you create or update service instances with the Resource Controller API, send `instance_limit_ru` and `usage_allocation_ru`. Do not send the `_seconds` parameters.\n"
msgstr "Si creas o actualizas instancias de servicio con la Resource Controller API, envía `instance_limit_ru` y `usage_allocation_ru`. No envíes los parámetros `_seconds`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change the labels in your user interface. Show \"RU\" or \"resource units\", not \"seconds\" or \"minutes\". Do not convert RUs to time. There is no fixed rate between RUs and time.\n"
msgstr "Cambia las etiquetas de tu interfaz de usuario. Muestra \"RU\" o \"unidades de recurso\", no \"segundos\" ni \"minutos\". No conviertas las RU a tiempo. No existe una equivalencia fija entre las RU y el tiempo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you read `usage.details[]`, use `value` for the usage in RUs. Do not use `metric.value`, because its unit is the unit of the metric.\n"
msgstr "Si lees `usage.details[]`, usa `value` para el uso en RU. No uses `metric.value`, porque su unidad es la unidad de la métrica.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If `usage.status` is `\"pending\"`, show the value as provisional.\n"
msgstr "Si `usage.status` es `\"pending\"`, muestra el valor como provisional.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If an RU field is missing or `null`, use the same logic that you use for the old field today.\n"
msgstr "Si falta un campo de RU o es `null`, usa la misma lógica que usas hoy para el campo antiguo.\n"
